Tendrils of flame fire from your hands in a narrow cone. Any foes caught inside will be pulled in towards you and have its movement speed reduced by [16%, 25%, 31%, 34%, 37% (TL1-5)] for 4 turns.

Each tendril will leave a trail of fire in its path dealing [45, 60, 72, 82, 91 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage for 4 turns.

The damage increases with spellpower.
